                    <td rowspan="2">점심 식사</td>
                    <td rowspan="22">신약성경 <br /> 맥잡기</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>13:00~13:30</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>13:30~14:00</td>
                    <td rowspan="2">찬양과 예배 2</td>
                </tr>


                <tr>
